{%- comment -%}
  HOW WOULD YOU LIKE TO SHOP — the section that explains the business.

  This is the most important block on the site. A first-time visitor should
  read it and understand CaratForUs in a few seconds: five ways to buy, one
  line each, all visible together.

  DESIGN NOTE ON IMAGERY. Each card takes an OPTIONAL image. With one, the
  photo sits on top and the words sit underneath on ivory — never over the
  picture, because copy that has to fight a photograph is copy a customer
  skips. Without one, the card is a clean champagne panel with a gold
  hairline. Both states are deliberate and finished; the section does not
  look broken while real jewelry photography is still being produced.

  Caption-below is also why this reads as a shop rather than a campaign:
  overlay text turns every card into its own poster, which is exactly the
  "five separate campaigns" problem this replaces.
{%- endcomment -%}

{{ 'carat-editorial.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<section class="carat-paths color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme | default: 'scheme-1' }} gradient">
  <div class="carat-paths__head page-width">
    {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
      <p class="carat-eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
      <h2 class="carat-paths__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  <div class="carat-paths__grid page-width">
    {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
      {%- assign img = block.settings.image -%}
      <a class="carat-path{% unless img %} carat-path--plain{% endunless %}" href="{{ block.settings.link | default: '#' }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
        {%- comment -%}
          No image means NO media box. The first attempt rendered an empty
          champagne panel at the same 4:5 as the photographs, and a row of
          four blank rectangles beside one picture looked unfinished rather
          than restrained. A card with no photograph is now a typographic
          card with a gold rule above it — a finished thing in its own right,
          which is what it has to be while real jewelry photography does not
          exist yet.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if img != blank -%}
          <div class="carat-path__media">
            <img
              src="{{ img | image_url: width: 700 }}"
              srcset="{{ img | image_url: width: 450 }} 450w, {{ img | image_url: width: 700 }} 700w, {{ img | image_url: width: 1000 }} 1000w"
              sizes="(min-width: 990px) 20vw, (min-width: 750px) 33vw, 80vw"
              alt="{{ img.alt | escape }}"
              width="{{ img.width }}"
              height="{{ img.height }}"
              loading="lazy"
              class="carat-path__img"
            >
          </div>
        {%- else -%}
          <span class="carat-path__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        {%- endif -%}
        <div class="carat-path__copy">
          <h3 class="carat-path__title">{{ block.settings.title | escape }}</h3>
          {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
            <p class="carat-path__text">{{ block.settings.text | escape }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
          <span class="carat-path__cue" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Carat shopping paths",
  "tag": "section",
  "max_blocks": 6,
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "How would you like to shop?" },
    { "type": "color_scheme", "id": "color_scheme", "label": "Colour scheme", "default": "scheme-1" }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "path",
      "name": "Path",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Image (optional)" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Title", "default": "Title" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "text", "label": "One line" },
        { "type": "url", "id": "link", "label": "Link" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Carat shopping paths" }]
}
{% endschema %}
